# How to Run the Project

## Step 1 – Flash MicroPython

Install MicroPython firmware on the ESP32 board.

## Step 2 – Open Thonny IDE

Connect the ESP32 to the computer using USB.

## Step 3 – Upload Python Files

Upload the Python files to the ESP32 board.

## Step 4 – Configure WiFi & Telegram

Change these values inside the code:


SSID = "YOUR_WIFI_NAME"
PASSWORD = "YOUR_WIFI_PASSWORD"

BOT_TOKEN = "YOUR_BOT_TOKEN"
CHAT_ID = "YOUR_CHAT_ID"


## Step 5 – Run Program

Run the Python file in Thonny IDE.

