# Flowchart

START
  ↓
Connect WiFi
  ↓
Read DHT22 Sensor
  ↓
Check Telegram Commands
  ↓
Temperature Above Threshold?
 ├── YES
 │    ├── Relay OFF → Send Alert
 │    └── Relay ON → Stop Alerts
 │
 └── NO
      ├── Relay ON → Auto OFF
      └── Relay OFF → Continue
  ↓
Wait 5 Seconds
  ↓
Repeat


